  lines:
  - speakerName: Hint
    text: 'Two halves, and only the second one completes the step.


      Same console,
      Users still selected: <b>New > Group</b>

      Group name:  <b>STUDENTS</b>

      Scope
      <b>Global</b>, type <b>Security</b> - only a security group can be given permissions.


      STUDENTS
      Properties opens on General. Click the <b>Members</b> tab, type <b>student01</b>,
      and press <b>Add</b>. That is the step.'
